{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a modern, premium Shopify homepage section inspired by the attached reference image.
    
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include any human/person image.
    - The entire right-side area should be replaced with a clean botanical/plant-themed visual area or a subtle decorative background.
    - Use actual Shopify product data/images for the plants instead of hardcoded images.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    Create a horizontal featured-products section with two main areas:
    
    LEFT SIDE – PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    - Approximately 60% of the section width.
    - Display 3 product cards at a time on desktop.
    - Product cards should have rounded corners around 18–22px.
    - Cards should have a large product image at the top.
    - Use the Shopify product featured image dynamically.
    - Image area should have a warm, soft lifestyle background.
    - Maintain consistent image aspect ratio and crop.
    - Add a small yellow "BESTSELLER" pill at the top-left of the image.
    - Add a red discount badge at the top-right showing the product's discount percentage dynamically.
    - Below the image, show:
      - Star rating
      - Review count
      - Product title
      - Short product description
      - Current price
      - Original price with strikethrough
      - Circular dark-green Add to Cart button with a white shopping-bag/cart icon.
    
    PRODUCT CARD STYLE:
    - Background: white
    - Border radius: 18–22px
    - No heavy border
    - Very subtle shadow
    - Product title should use an elegant serif font.
    - Product description and price should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Product title approximately 20–22px.
    - Description approximately 15–16px.
    - Price should be bold.
    - Original price should be light gray and crossed out.
    - Add-to-cart button should be approximately 44–48px circular.
    - Use smooth hover animation.
    - On hover, slightly lift the card and add a subtle shadow.
    - Product image should have a very subtle zoom effect on hover.
    
    CAROUSEL:
    - Show exactly 3 cards on desktop.
    - Add a circular dark-green right-arrow button overlapping the right edge of the third card.
    - Arrow button should be approximately 40–44px.
    - Use a clean white arrow icon.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - On tablet show 2 cards.
    - On mobile show 1 card.
    - Allow touch/swipe scrolling on mobile.
    - Do not show ugly default browser scrollbars.
    
    RIGHT SIDE:
    - Approximately 40% of the section width.
    - DO NOT USE A HUMAN IMAGE.
    - Instead create a clean premium botanical visual composition.
    - Use a warm cream/light-yellow background.
    - Add subtle abstract organic shapes behind the plants.
    - Display several decorative indoor plants, leaves, or botanical illustrations arranged naturally.
    - The visual should feel like a premium nursery website.
    - Keep this area visually balanced with the product cards.
    - Do not place too much text here.
    - Optionally add a small elegant heading such as:
      "Bring Nature Home"
      with a short supporting line:
      "Fresh plants for happier spaces."
    - Keep the typography minimal.
    
    BACKGROUND:
    - Overall section background should be warm cream/off-white.
    - Use soft pale-yellow abstract shapes similar to the reference.
    - Avoid excessive gradients.
    - Keep the overall look premium, clean, modern and natural.
    
    COLOR PALETTE:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow: #FFD60A
    - Warm cream: #FFF9E8
    - White: #FFFFFF
    - Soft red for discount badge: #D92D20
    - Dark text: #172018
    - Light gray: #9A9A9A
    
    SHOPIFY FUNCTIONALITY:
    - Build this as a reusable Shopify Liquid section.
    - Products must be selected dynamically using Shopify's product/collection settings.
    - Allow the merchant to select a collection from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Automatically display products from the selected collection.
    - Product title, image, price, compare-at-price and product URL must come dynamically from Shopify.
    - Calculate and display discount percentage automatically when compare-at-price exists.
    - Add-to-cart button must actually add the selected product to the Shopify cart using AJAX without refreshing the page.
    - Make the entire product card clickable to the product page except the Add to Cart button.
    - If a product has no compare-at-price, hide the discount badge.
    - If there is no review data, hide the rating/review area instead of showing fake ratings.
    
    SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR SETTINGS:
    Include settings for:
    - Collection selection
    - Number of products
    - Section heading
    - Section description
    - Background color
    - Card background color
    - Enable/disable bestseller badge
    - Enable/disable rating
    - Enable/disable carousel
    - Enable/disable right-side botanical visual
    - Mobile cards per view
    - Desktop cards per view
    
    RESPONSIVE DESIGN:
    Desktop:
    - Two-column layout.
    - Product cards occupy approximately 60%.
    - Botanical visual occupies approximately 40%.
    - 3 product cards visible.
    
    Tablet:
    - Product carousel takes most of the width.
    - Botanical visual becomes smaller.
    
    Mobile:
    - Stack the layout vertically.
    - Product carousel first.
    - Botanical visual below the products.
    - Show one product card at a ti, Design Layout
    Create a full-width horizontal product showcase section with a soft cream/off-white background.
    Use a 2-column layout:
    Left side: Product carousel occupying approximately 60% of the section.
    Right side: Decorative promotional area occupying approximately 40%, with abstract cream and light-yellow geometric shapes/rays, but no human image.
    The section should have rounded corners and a clean premium nursery/e-commerce appearance.
    Product Carousel
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each card should contain:
    
    Large plant/product image at the top.
    Image container with rounded top corners.
    Small yellow “BESTSELLER” pill at the top-left of the image.
    Small red discount badge such as “15% OFF” at the top-right.
    Rating badge near the bottom-left of the image: 4.8 ★ | 440
    Product name in a bold elegant serif-style font.
    Short product description below the name.
    Current price in bold.
    Original price in light grey with strikethrough.
    Circular dark-green shopping-bag/cart button at the bottom-right.
    Example Product Content
    
    Product 1
    
    Name: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8 ★ | 440
    
    Product 2
    
    Name: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8 ★ | 111
    
    Product 3
    
    Name: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8 ★ | 414
    Product Images
    
    Do not generate or hardcode human images.
    The merchant should be able to select the plant/product images from Shopify's theme customizer.
    Add an image picker for every product card so I can upload/select my own plant images.
    
    Right Promotional Area
    Do NOT use a person or human photograph.
    Keep the area visually attractive using:
    Large soft-yellow abstract rays
    Cream background
    Subtle organic botanical shapes
    Optional decorative leaves/plant silhouettes
    Leave enough clean space so I can later add my own promotional image or graphic if required.
    Add a prominent circular dark-green carousel arrow button positioned between the product carousel and promotional area.
    Colors
    
    Use a premium nursery color palette:
    
    Dark green: #1F5130
    Yellow: #FFD60A
    Cream: #FFF9E8
    White: #FFFFFF
    Soft grey for secondary text
    Red for discount badges
    Interactions
    Product cards should have a subtle 3D lift/scale hover animation.
    Shopping/cart button should have a smooth hover animation.
    Carousel arrow should smoothly slide to the next products.
    Use touch/swipe support on mobile.
    Add smooth transitions without making the section feel excessive.
    Responsive Design
    
    Desktop: 3 product cards + promotional area visible.
    
    Tablet: 2 product cards visible + promotional area reduced.
    
    Mobile: 1 product card visible at a time, horizontally swipeable carousel. Hide or significantly reduce the promotional area so the product cards remain the main focus.
    
    Shopify Requirements
    Build this as a reusable Shopify Liquid section.
    Use Shopify section schema so I can customize:
    Product images
    Product names
    Descriptions
    Prices
    Original prices
    Discount percentages
    Ratings
    Review counts
    Bestseller badge
    Colors
    Allow products to be selected directly from Shopify where possible.
    Do not use external libraries.
    Keep the code lightweight and optimized.
    Use clean HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
    Make sure it works properly inside Shopify's theme editor.
    Do not include any human/person image anywhere in this section.
    Match the overall visual hierarchy and proportions of the reference image while creating an original Shopify implementation.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;padding:clamp(24px,5vw,64px) 0;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};color:#172018}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1400px;margin:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(280px,1fr);gap:20px;align-items:stretch}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products{min-width:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,.24);border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(16px,2vw,28px);position:relative}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0 0 6px;color:#1f5130;font:600 clamp(28px,3vw,42px)/1.05 Georgia,serif}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description{margin:0 0 20px;color:#5b6660;font-size:15px}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{overflow:hidden}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:calc((100% - 32px)/3);gap:16px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scrollbar-width:none;padding:3px 3px 10px}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{min-width:0;scroll-snap-align:start;background:{{ block.settings.card_background_color }};border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(31,81,48,.08);transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;position:relative}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.01);box-shadow:0 13px 28px rgba(31,81,48,.16)}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1.04;background:#f4ead0;overflow:hidden}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .3s ease}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card:hover .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image img{transform:scale(1.04)}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill{position:absolute;top:11px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:99px;font:700 10px Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.05em}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__best{left:11px;background:#ffd60a}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount{right:11px;background:#d92d20;color:#fff}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{position:absolute;bottom:11px;left:11px;background:#fff;color:#1f5130;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px;font:700 11px Arial,sans-serif}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{padding:14px 15px 18px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{margin:0 0 6px;font:600 20px/1.12 Georgia,serif}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{min-height:39px;margin:0 0 12px;color:#5b6660;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{font:700 16px Arial,sans-serif}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare{margin-left:7px;color:#9a9a9a;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;text-decoration:line-through}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:13px;bottom:12px;width:45px;height:45px;border:0;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .2s ease,background .2s ease}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart:hover{transform:scale(1.08);background:#0d3a1d}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart svg{width:19px;height:19px}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:-22px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);width:46px;height:46px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1f5130;color:#fff;font-size:25px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.18);transition:transform .2s ease}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:hover{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(1.08);background:#0d3a1d}
  .ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo{min-height:430px;border-radius:24px;background:#fff9e8;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;padding:30px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo:before,.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo:after{content:'';position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:#f4df78;opacity:.7}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo:before{width:330px;height:150px;right:-80px;top:30px;transform:rotate(25deg)}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo:after{width:260px;height:180px;left:-90px;bottom:-50px;background:#e2edc7}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-copy{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:210px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo h3{margin:0 0 8px;color:#1f5130;font:600 31px/1.05 Georgia,serif}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo p{margin:0;color:#5b6660;font-size:14px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf{position:absolute;z-index:1;right:18%;bottom:18px;width:130px;height:250px;border-left:13px solid #c88755;border-right:13px solid #c88755;border-radius:0 0 45% 45%}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf:before,.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf:after{content:'';position:absolute;background:#1f5130;border-radius:100% 0 100% 0;width:75px;height:125px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf:before{left:-62px;top:22px;transform:rotate(-35deg)}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf:after{right:-62px;top:80px;transform:rotate(35deg)}
  @media(max-width:989px){.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{grid-auto-columns:calc((100% - 16px)/2)}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo{min-height:240px}}
  @media(max-width:600px){.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{width:calc(100% - 24px)}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{grid-auto-columns:100%}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow{right:10px;top:26px;transform:none}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow:hover{transform:scale(1.08)}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo{min-height:190px;padding:22px}.ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf{transform:scale(.7);transform-origin:bottom right;right:6%}}
{% endstyle %}

<product-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout">
    <div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__products">
      <h2 class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h2><p class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
      <div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport"><div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track" data-track>
        {% for i in (1..3) %}
          {% liquid
            assign product_key = 'product_' | append: i
            assign image_key = 'image_' | append: i
            assign product = block.settings[product_key]
            assign image = block.settings[image_key]
          %}
          {% if product != blank %}
            {% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}
            <article class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card">
              <a href="{{ product.url }}" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;display:block">
                <div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__image">{% if image != blank %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width:700 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="700" height="728">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width:700 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="700" height="728">{% else %}{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}{% endif %}{% if block.settings.show_bestseller %}<span class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__best">BESTSELLER</span>{% endif %}{% if product.compare_at_price_max > product.price %}{% assign discount = product.compare_at_price_max | minus: product.price | times:100 | divided_by:product.compare_at_price_max %}<span class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__pill ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__discount">{{ discount }}% OFF</span>{% endif %}{% assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value %}{% assign count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value %}{% if block.settings.show_rating and rating != blank %}<span class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">{{ rating | round: 1 }} ★{% if count != blank %} | {{ count }}{% endif %}</span>{% endif %}</div>
                <div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body"><h3 class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{{ product.title }}</h3><p class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 70 }}</p><div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{{ product.price | money }}{% if product.compare_at_price_max > product.price %}<span class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__compare">{{ product.compare_at_price_max | money }}</span>{% endif %}</div></div>
              </a>
              {% if variant.available %}<button type="button" class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" data-variant="{{ variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }} to cart"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 8h16l-1 12H5L4 8Z"/><path d="M8 8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0"/></svg></button>{% endif %}
            </article>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div></div>{% if block.settings.enable_carousel %}<button class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" type="button" data-next aria-label="Next products">→</button>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% if block.settings.show_promo %}<aside class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo"><div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__promo-copy"><h3>{{ block.settings.promo_heading }}</h3><p>{{ block.settings.promo_text }}</p></div><div class="ai-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}__leaf" aria-hidden="true"></div></aside>{% endif %}
  </div>
</product-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){class ProductShowcase{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){const track=this.querySelector('[data-track]'),next=this.querySelector('[data-next]');if(next&&track)next.addEventListener('click',()=>track.scrollBy({left:track.clientWidth*.72,behavior:'smooth'}));this.querySelectorAll('[data-variant]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async event=>{event.preventDefault();event.stopPropagation();button.disabled=true;try{await fetch('/cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:Number(button.dataset.variant),quantity:1}]})});button.setAttribute('aria-label','Added to cart')}finally{button.disabled=false}}))}}customElements.define('product-showcase-{{ ai_gen_id }}',ProductShowcase{{ ai_gen_id }})})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Plant product showcase","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Content"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Bring nature home"},{"type":"textarea","id":"description","label":"Description","default":"Thoughtfully selected plants for happier spaces."},{"type":"product","id":"product_1","label":"Product 1"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_1","label":"Product image 1"},{"type":"product","id":"product_2","label":"Product 2"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_2","label":"Product image 2"},{"type":"product","id":"product_3","label":"Product 3"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"image_3","label":"Product image 3"},{"type":"header","content":"Promotional area"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_promo","label":"Show promotional area","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"promo_heading","label":"Promo heading","default":"Grow something beautiful"},{"type":"textarea","id":"promo_text","label":"Promo text","default":"Fresh greenery for every corner."},{"type":"header","content":"Display"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_bestseller","label":"Show bestseller badge","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_rating","label":"Show ratings","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_carousel","label":"Enable carousel arrow","default":true},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#FFF9E8"},{"type":"color","id":"card_background_color","label":"Card background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100}],"presets":[{"name":"Plant product showcase"}],"tag":null,"class":"plant-product-showcase"}{% endschema %}